{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:33 2026-11-21 HKT<br/>發佈時間：13:13 2026-11-21 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：13:13 2026-11-21 HKT</p><img alt=\"將軍澳厚德邨啡黑貓困三樓冷氣機頂 消防愛協齊救援\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c20828ff480d9ac0696e715e3ba7ae47/2026-11/20261121_news_3__si.png\"/><p>今(21日)早上約11時半，將軍澳厚德邨德富樓，據報一隻啡黑色家貓被果三樓的冷氣機頂，消防接報到場，愛護動物協會亦接通知到場協助，現場所見，貓兒伏在冷氣機頂上，時而半身伸出機身，似欲墮下，驚險萬分，而消防員則在樓上單位，用捕貓網伸出窗戶，最終以貓網救起貓兒，將牠帶回安全位置。</p><img alt=\"消防伸出捕貓網欲網住被困家貓。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7c0a3681e344d18ef8d62c91e72fe8ec/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-21_at_12_57_49.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"啡黑家貓伏在冷氣機頂上。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0bf587843bfd98cf04cdf171472d5b8a/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-21_at_12_57_48_3_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"貓兒在機頂伸出半身，十分驚險。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f03ace38e70ffd783126534032cf886d/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-21_at_12_57_48_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/756bda807f7cb45096f2cda791bcdaec/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-21_at_12_57_48.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5817178ec828f921a48939d28cb7549b/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-21_at_12_57_49_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9bf79a186f3968d0099a0fbe797336d5/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-21_at_12_57_47.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T08:24:12.783840+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":221,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T07:33:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T12:17:34.107914+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T08:17:47.312370+00:00","content_hash":"db5d6c9c6ca1bcc6a162c0c23390bdb5da29f82128bd80c6666449b3874dee8d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}